       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-CST-AFFORD.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CST-AFFORD-PROOFS.
           05  WS-NO-PROMPT-FATIGUE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TANGIBLE-AFFORDANCE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NEURODYNAMIC-STABLE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FEEDBACK-COMMUTATION-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CST-AFFORD-SEAL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CST-AFFORD-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-CST-AFFORD-PROVEN    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CST-AFFORD-CODE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-FATIGUE-AND-AFFORDANCE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-STABILITY-AND-FEEDBACK.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-CST-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-FATIGUE-AND-AFFORDANCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NO-PROMPT-FATIGUE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TANGIBLE-AFFORDANCE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-STABILITY-AND-FEEDBACK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NEURODYNAMIC-STABLE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FEEDBACK-COMMUTATION-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-CST-PROOFS.
           IF WS-NO-PROMPT-FATIGUE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TANGIBLE-AFFORDANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-NEURODYNAMIC-STABLE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FEEDBACK-COMMUTATION-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-CST-AFFORD-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-CST-AFFORD-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CST-AFFORD-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-CST-AFFORD-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CST-AFFORD-CODE.
